    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first is istighfar, asking Allah, the one God, for forgiveness. In the Qur'an it brings rain, wealth, and gardens.",
      "video": "main/broll6/three-rizq/2-point-one.mp4",
      "videoDuration": 13,
