        "style": 0.16,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.99
      },
      "arabicText": "ٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟ رَبَّكُمْ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ غَفَّارًۭا • يُرْسِلِ ٱلسَّمَآءَ عَلَيْكُم مِّدْرَارًۭا",
      "foot": "Qur'an 71:10-12 (Surah Nuh)"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The second is taqwa, living mindful of God, with tawakkul, trusting Him. He then makes a way out for you.",
